"rich_text","block_id":"UqU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"967f8cf9-d111-4a92-b169-d54adf905d55","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"（そういう意味でも、パスワードの自由度が低いサービスはジェネレータの設定を絞り込みやすいので優先的に狙われそう）","ts":"1625621262.353800","edited":{"user":"UL6CFN8NR","ts":"1625621304.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5ySU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a4e1d8c6-d56a-4e96-ba80-29420ed0cb4a","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"攻撃する対象サービスが決まっていれば桁の上限や文字種制限もわかるので、それを元に絞れば良いかと。\nもともと文字種のオプションもそんなバラエティ豊かではないでしょうし","ts":"1625621215.352700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DGV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8eb4898f-98e2-4ab7-b8cb-07b6261cd7b0","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"あー、まあそうでね\nただ、パスワードジェネレータに桁の設定とか、文字種の設定なかったのかな...?(サイトによってそれがないと死ぬ)\nで、それらがあると簡単に決定的にはならないかなと思ったんですが","ts":"1625620705.348700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JQ4Tx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6b279ff3-86e1-4c95-9e64-ac9edb2020b7","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"秒だけだと10年でもせいぜい 3.1 億くらいしかパターンないしな。生成アルゴリズムは割れてるものと考えてよいだろうし、全部のパスワードを出すのはそんなに難しくなさそう","ts":"1625620560.347700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["UL6CFN8NR"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Wnb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e79c86e1-0bb3-4b0e-b23f-ed4df019deb4","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"安全な乱数難しい","ts":"1625620356.346400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zHN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9762baf2-dc92-4017-9c26-a5a8573b7511","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"(単純に秒がシードだったとしてもアレだけど、それだけならここまで楽でもない気がするし)","ts":"1625619967.346200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uBr"}]},{"